  (text "FLOW: 6S-12S BATT -> PDN -> { Orin 12V | Cube 5.3V | Herelink 7.4V | Periph 5V/3V3 }\nOrin UART1+UART2 -> TXU0204 shifters (1.8V<->3.3V) -> Cube TELEM1/TELEM2 (internal, no headers)\nOrin GBE_MDI0/1 -> HX1188NL magnetics -> JST-GH 5p -> Herelink ETH (GND = middle pin 3)\nOrin PCIe0 x4 Gen4 -> M.2 Key M NVMe.  CSI0/CSI1 -> 2x 15-pin FFC.  USB1+USBSS -> USB-A 3.0.  USB0 -> USB-C recovery.\nCube DF17 -> GPS1/GPS2/CAN1/CAN2/I2C/RCIN/USB/buzzer/MAIN1-8/AUX1-6 (standard CubePilot JST-GH map).\n\nLAYOUT RULE: Cube + its internal compasses at the board end OPPOSITE the buck cluster and battery entry.\nNETCLASSES preset in project: PCIE_85R / USB_90R / DIFF_100R / CAN_120R / POWER - recompute widths for the chosen fab stackup."
